            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ladybuggs5224"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an interesting way to fry potatos I ended up getting my pan to full out of sheer laziness of not wanting to do 2 batches but they still taste like a good fried tater. I did add some onions to mine (IMO it cant be fried taters without onion) and added garlic salt that had parsley flakes in it already. I really enjoyed the garlic salt on them and my 6yo went wild for them.",
            "datePublished": "2009-11-30T20:17:44.547Z"
          },
          {
