            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DREGINEK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Funky twist to fries! I added a dash of all-season salt too for both color and taste. Go easy on the garlic salt (add to taste) b/c my first batch was a little too salty but otherwise good. Tried dipping in ranch dressing per a previous reviewer - which was good too. Thanks!",
